			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">C</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Immediately prior to closing of the Merger, EIP&#8217;s Convertible Notes will convert into EIP Common Stock that will subsequently be converted into the right to receive shares of Diffusion Common Stock upon closing of the Merger.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">D</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Immediately prior to closing of the Merger, EIP&#8217;s Preferred Stock will convert into EIP Common Stock that will subsequently be converted into the right to receive shares of Diffusion Common Stock upon closing of the Merger.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">E</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">To record the (i) Exchange Ratio adjustment to EIP Common Stock outstanding, (ii) conversion of EIP Preferred Stock into EIP Common Stock, (iii) automatic conversion of the EIP Convertible Notes into EIP Common Stock, (iv) elimination of Diffusion&#8217;s historical equity carrying value, (v) issuance of shares of common stock of the continuing company to EIP shareholders, (vi) recording of transaction and severance costs:</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

