			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Elimination of change in fair value associated with the EIP Convertible Notes upon conversion into common stock as of January 1, 2023 and January 1, 2022, respectively.</p>
			</td>
